<title>USA: Rowan gets US govt loan guarantee for rig.</title>
<headline>Rowan gets US govt loan guarantee for rig.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rowan Cos Inc said on Friday the U.S. Department of Transportation's Maritime Administration has committed to provide a Title XI guarantee of a $153 million loan to finance the building of a new rig.</p>
<p>The floating-rate bank loan would be repaid semi-annually over 12 years after the &quot;Rowan Gorilla V&quot; rig was completed.</p>
<p>Rowan is an international and domestic offshore contract drilling and aviation services provider.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
